WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.641
"I'm going to clean my closet," said Aunt Judy.

2
00:00:07.642 --> 00:00:11.076
"I have lots of old clothes.

3
00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:15.562
I need room for my new clothes."

4
00:00:15.563 --> 00:00:18.880
"I will help," said Emmy.

5
00:00:18.881 --> 00:00:25.867
"I like old clothes!"

6
00:00:25.868 --> 00:00:32.515
"People wore funny clothes long ago," said Harry.

7
00:00:32.516 --> 00:00:37.654
"I like funny things!" said Oliver.

8
00:00:37.655 --> 00:00:42.599
Aunt Judy laughed.

9
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:46.988
"You can keep anything you like."

10
00:00:46.989 --> 00:00:50.602
"Thanks, Aunt Judy," said Emmy.

11
00:00:50.603 --> 00:00:54.506
"But nobody wears old clothes."

12
00:00:54.507 --> 00:01:02.344
"Nobody wears funny clothes either," said Harry.

13
00:01:02.345 --> 00:01:06.750
Aunt Judy opened her closet.

14
00:01:06.751 --> 00:01:09.933
She took out a green scarf.

15
00:01:09.934 --> 00:01:14.326
The scarf sparkled.

16
00:01:14.327 --> 00:01:17.416
"Cool!" said Emmy.

17
00:01:17.417 --> 00:01:21.581
Aunt Judy smiled.

18
00:01:21.582 --> 00:01:26.513
Emmy put on the scarf.

19
00:01:26.514 --> 00:01:30.382
Aunt Judy took out a hat.

20
00:01:30.383 --> 00:01:33.942
"Cool!" said Harry.

21
00:01:33.943 --> 00:01:37.264
"It looks like a spy's hat!"

22
00:01:37.265 --> 00:01:41.159
Harry put on the hat.

23
00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:46.781
Aunt Judy took out a white shirt.

24
00:01:46.782 --> 00:01:52.722
"I need a white shirt to play doctor!" said Oliver.

25
00:01:52.723 --> 00:01:55.611
Aunt Judy took out a sweater.

26
00:01:55.612 --> 00:01:59.489
The sweater had a lion on the front.

27
00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:05.795
"I love it!" said Emmy.

28
00:02:05.796 --> 00:02:10.914
Aunt Judy took out a vest.

29
00:02:10.915 --> 00:02:16.760
"I need a vest for my school play!" said Harry.

30
00:02:16.761 --> 00:02:20.144
Aunt Judy smiled.

31
00:02:20.145 --> 00:02:25.107
"Now I have room for new clothes," she said.

32
00:02:25.108 --> 00:02:32.540
"Now we need to clean our closets!" said Emmy.

